antiderivative of $y'(t)$.\n\n$y(t)=$\n{{field-1}}\n$+\\,C$" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671047 1072 #uuid "10e82ee6-837f-5483-bbea-742bf32b5839" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671047 1074 "We know that $y'(t)=-2+t^{6}$.\n\nApplying the sum rule, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\left(-2+t^{6}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}t &= \\int \\left(-2+t^{6}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &= -2\\int 1\\,\\mathrm{d}t+\\int t^{6}\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &= -2\\frac{t^{0+1}}{(0+1)}+\\frac{t^{6+1}}{(6+1)}+C \\\\ &= -2t+\\frac{t^{7}}{7}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAny additive constant in an antiderivative can be absorbed into the displayed arbitrary constant $C$." 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671048 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671060 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671048 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671048 1077 "field-1" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671048 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671060 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671048 1079 #uuid "23b81b98-ddee-5ebf-a2b4-d2474b1ec7fc" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671049 1080 "-\\frac{t^{3}}{3}+6t" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671049 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671049 1083 #uuid "265d13c3-577d-5fac-a55b-51d15a808773" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671050 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671055 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671050 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671050 1071 "Given $y'(t)=-t^{2}+6$, find $y(t)$, the antiderivative of $y'(t)$.\n\n$y(t)=$\n{{field-1}}\n$+\\,C$" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671050 1072 #uuid "2ced7f38-807e-5a63-8102-df1f51116f7a" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671050 1074 "We know that $y'(t)=-t^{2}+6$.\n\nApplying the sum rule, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\left(-t^{2}+6\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}t &= \\int \\left(-t^{2}+6\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &= -\\int t^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t+6\\int 1\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &= -\\frac{t^{2+1}}{(2+1)}+6\\frac{t^{0+1}}{(0+1)}+C \\\\ &= -\\frac{t^{3}}{3}+6t+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAny additive constant in an antiderivative can be absorbed into the displayed arbitrary constant $C$." 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671051 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671057 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671051 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671051 1071 "Find the integral of $3+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t^{3}}}$ for $t>0$.\n\n{{selection}}" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671051 1072 #uuid "392bd156-a25b-55e4-bce8-37c27fa38c55" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671051 1074 "Applying the sum rule, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\left(3+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t^{3}}}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}t &= \\int \\left(3+\\frac{1}{t^{\\frac{3}{2}}}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &= 3\\int 1\\,\\mathrm{d}t+\\int t^{-\\frac{3}{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &= 3\\frac{t^{0+1}}{(0+1)}+\\frac{t^{-\\frac{3}{2}+1}}{(-\\frac{3}{2}+1)}+C \\\\ &= 3t-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{t}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671052 1080 "3t-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{t}}+C" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671052 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671052 1083 #uuid "3c1b62dd-ead9-5f02-9ef2-9d6c9b599c85" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671053 1080 "3t-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}+C" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671053 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671053 1083 #uuid "3c5a129e-e655-5463-8fa5-e610d85ece00" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671054 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671046 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671054 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671054 1071 "$\\displaystyle\\int \\left(-6+x^{6}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=$\n\n{{selection}}" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671054 1072 #uuid "420d5e76-0051-5ab1-a5d9-92d8e39b4f48" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671054 1074 "Applying the sum rule, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\left(-6+x^{6}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x &= \\int \\left(-6+x^{6}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\ &= -6\\int 1\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int x^{6}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\ &= -6\\frac{x^{0+1}}{(0+1)}+\\frac{x^{6+1}}{(6+1)}+C \\\\ &= -6x+\\frac{x^{7}}{7}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671055 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671049 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671055 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671055 1077 "field-1" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671055 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671049 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671055 1079 #uuid "48da94e4-b9dd-5ebb-b7ec-06b9298abbe7" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671056 1080 "-3x+\\frac{x^{7}}{7}+C" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671056 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671056 1083 #uuid "4f92e116-4a5d-5079-842a-052dddf334e5" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671045 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671052 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671053 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671065 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671066 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1077 "selection" 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671052 13194139538631 17592186045443 true] [17592186671057 1079